'''Platform twenty''' was one of many [[Scrapper Guild]] platforms on the [[planet]] [[Bracca]]. While on a [[Resistance]] [[Mission to Bracca|mission]] to Bracca with [[Shriv Suurgav]]'s [[Dross Squadron]], [[Raidah Doon]] was picked up as a known criminal by [[First Order]] [[First Order stormtrooper|stormtroopers]]. Another member of the team, [[Wesson Dove]], claimed that Doon had joined them on the [[train]] at platform twenty.<ref name="Resistance Reborn" />

